<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 8 }}>LANGGRAPH BASICS</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 24 }}>LangGraph 三要素：State / Node / Edge</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 26 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 22, flex: 1 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: '26px 24px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", monospace', marginBottom: 10 }}>State</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 10 }}>共享状态</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          贯穿全图的数据容器，节点读它、写它，是所有节点协作的纽带。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: '26px 24px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", monospace', marginBottom: 10 }}>Node</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 10 }}>处理节点</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          一个节点干一件事：调模型、查工具、做判断，输入输出都是 State。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#16263F', borderRadius: 14, padding: '26px 24px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", monospace', marginBottom: 10 }}>Edge</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginBottom: 10 }}>连接与路由</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          定义节点间流向，条件边根据 State 动态决定下一步，实现循环与分支。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 22, background: '#DCE7F5', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 22px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
      <FAIcon name='lightbulb' style={{ fill: '#FF9F1C', width: 20, height: 20 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
        HelloWorld：一个「查日期」工具 Agent = 起始节点 → 工具节点 → 结束节点，边连起来就成图
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, right: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 6 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>11 / 14</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
